{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6eb0e3cd-8867-830c-8e24-f432fd0672d5",
  "created_at": "2025-12-10T12:17:25-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bridget Quinn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:14:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:14:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. Yes. I'm calling about a pothole. A [pause] pothole, on my street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:14:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can take that down. Whereabouts is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:14:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 249 Carroll Avenue. That's in the Fifth Ward. The hole is right out front, near the edge of the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:14:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 249 Carroll Avenue. Got it. Is this a new one, or have you called about it before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:14:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it was filled. Last week. Somebody came out with the cold patch, the, um, the black stuff. And it has [pause] washed out. All of it. It's gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:14:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, so the patch didn't hold. Yeah, that happens with cold patch when we get a good rain. It just gets pushed right out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:15:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And now the hole is full of water. Full. You can't see how deep it is, and it's hard to see at all, unless you are looking right at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:15:13-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the part that worries me too, honestly. Somebody could drive right into it. Let me put that in. Hole refilled with water, patch washed out, hard to see. How big would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:15:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, about the size of a [pause] a dinner platter. Maybe a little bigger. A car tire would go right down in it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:15:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, dinner platter, car tire goes in. Is it in the travel lane or over by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:15:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's toward the curb, but cars swing around the parked ones, so they go near it. Near it, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:15:51-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note that it's by the curb but in the path of traffic. And I'm marking it as a repeat, since it was patched last week, so the crew knows a second cold patch probably isn't the answer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:16:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be good. Thank you. Could I have a reference number? For the report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:16:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Hang on, it's generating. Okay, your reference number is PW-1210-47. I'll go slow. P, W, dash, one, two, one, zero, dash, four, seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:16:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "P, W, one, two, one, zero, four, seven. Let me write that down. [pause] Yes. I have it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:16:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Do you want a call back when it's scheduled, or are you fine just watching for the crew?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:16:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A call back would be fine. My number is 401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:16:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero-one-nine-four, got it. Name for the report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:16:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bridget Quinn. Q-U-I-N-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:16:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Ms. Quinn. Q-U-I-N-N, 249 Carroll. Anything else going on over there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:16:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. I just wanted it reported. I put together a monthly newsletter for a neighborhood book swap, and I'd like to be able to tell people it's been taken care of."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:17:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, that's good of you to keep people posted. I can't say the day, but a repair like this is usually looked at within a few days. The number will let you check on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:17:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Very good. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:17:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:17:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
